      <pattern name="maker binding recipe" location="projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/notes/matter-form-binding-instructions.md">The form-designer binding walkthrough Phase 5 followed — fold the R2 (layoutJson) version of this into the guide's configure-a-new-entity section.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare rigor level (STANDARD) and load knowledge files per task-execute Step 0.5.</step>
    <step order="1">Read the shipped RecordHeader control end-to-end: ControlManifest.Input.xml (property set incl. layoutJson), index.ts, the generic view, resolveHeaderConfig + the RecordHeaderConfiguration types, toolbarLaunchDefaults.ts (RECORDSUMMARY_FIELD, both parent maps incl. sprk_agreement). Also read one live layoutJson example from a Phase 5 form binding (design.md §9 layouts are the shipped defaults).</step>
    <step order="2">Read the old guide ONCE to inventory: (a) the surviving-content candidates, (b) the exact boundaries of the Bundle Optimization triad block to preserve verbatim, (c) every drift item from the background list. Do not reuse its per-entity sections as source material.</step>
    <step order="3">Rewrite: Purpose/Prerequisites → configuring the ONE control; replace "Per-Entity Thin PCF Pattern" (manifest/class/view walkthrough) with "Configure the header for a new entity" — form binding on the entity's MAIN form, layoutJson authoring (schema v1.0, spans, columns, clamp, no-apostrophes manifest trap), derived defaults when no JSON is supplied, summary sparkle via the sprk_recordsummary default, toolbar slot auto-hide and what adding a new To Do/Memo parent requires.</step>
    <step order="4">Carry over and re-verify the surviving sections; correct modal sizes (Notepad 25%×35%; SmartTodo openTodos filtered launch), delete the recordSummary hook param, delete the ADR-011 misreading, state that the manual FluentProvider wrap IS required, fix "four" → 5 version locations.</step>
    <step order="5">Verify with greps (see acceptance criteria) and a full read-through; confirm the triad block is byte-identical.</step>
    <step order="6">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅.</step>
    <step order="7">Document any deviation in projects/record-header-and-notepad-r2/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

