  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Grep of the guide for "Per-Entity", "ProjectHeader", "&lt;Entity&gt;HeaderView", and "recordId" (as a manifest property) returns zero matches — no reference to the retired per-entity recipe survives (FR-27 acceptance).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The "Bundle Optimization — MANDATORY for Consuming PCFs" section (Fix 1 / Fix 2 / Fix 3, ~57 lines) is byte-identical to the pre-task version (verify via git diff hunk boundaries).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The guide states the version number appears in FIVE locations; grep for "four locations"/"4 locations" returns zero matches.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The guide's manifest excerpt matches the shipped src/client/pcf/RecordHeader/control/ControlManifest.Input.xml property set (layoutJson + boundField + title + showVersion), and its modal/launch claims match shipped code (Notepad 25%×35%; SmartTodo openTodos filtered launch).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Grep for "recordSummary" (the retired hook parameter), "no runtime schemas", and any claim that platform-library theming makes the manual FluentProvider unnecessary returns zero matches; the guide affirmatively states the manual FluentProvider wrap is required for portal-mounted Fluent surfaces.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: git status shows the guide as the ONLY modified file for this task.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Spec refs: FR-27; design.md §3.1 (scoping: ~170-190 of ~354 lines replaced, ~120 survive; triad block survives).
    The old guide is a drift EXHIBIT, not a source — treat its six known drift items as a checklist of claims that
    must not reappear. Task 086 (pattern pointer refresh) depends on this task and links to the rewritten guide.
